  "pli-tv-kd5:2.1.12": "According to SED, the <i lang='pi' translate='no'>mahāraṅga</i> (sv. <i lang='pi' translate='no'>mahārajana</i>) is the safflower, which is normally deep yellow or orange. Sp 3.246: <i lang='pi' translate='no'>Mahānāmarattā sambhinnavaṇṇā hoti paṇḍupalāsavaṇṇā</i>, “<i lang='pi' translate='no'>Mahānāmaratta</i> is a mixed color, the color of withered leaves.” ",
