  "pli-tv-kd5:2.4.6": "Sp 3.246: <i lang='pi' translate='no'>Lūvakacammaparikkhaṭāti pakkhibiḷālacammaparikkhaṭā</i>, “<i lang='pi' translate='no'>Luvakacammaparikkhaṭa</i>: decorated with the skin of a winged cat.” Sp-yoj 3.246: <i lang='pi' translate='no'>Pakkhibiḷāloti tuliyo</i>, “A winged cat is a flying fox.” ",
