  "pli-tv-kd5:8.1.4": "“Grass” covers two separate Pali terms, <i lang='pi' translate='no'>tiṇa</i>, and <i lang='pi' translate='no'>kamala</i>. “Reed” covers two separate Pali terms, <i lang='pi' translate='no'>muñja</i> and <i lang='pi' translate='no'>pabbaja</i>. ",
