  "pli-tv-kd5:9.4.1": "Sp 3.253: <i lang='pi' translate='no'>Itthiyuttenāti dhenuyuttena. Purisantarenāti purisasārathinā. Purisayuttenāti goṇayuttena. Itthantarenāti itthisārathinā</i>, “<i lang='pi' translate='no'>Itthiyuttena</i>: with a yoked cow. <i lang='pi' translate='no'>Purisantarena</i>: with a man charioteer. <i lang='pi' translate='no'>Purisayuttena</i>: with a yoked bull. <i lang='pi' translate='no'>Itthantarenā</i>: with a woman charioteer.” ",
